    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Xylem transports water and minerals unidirectionally, whereas Phloem conducts synthesized food bidirectionally.",
        "The light-dependent reaction of photosynthesis occurs in Grana, while the light-independent (Dark) reaction occurs in Stroma.",
        "Ethylene is the primary natural gaseous phytohormone responsible for fruit ripening.",
        "Asexual vegetative propagation produces genetically identical offspring from roots, stems, or leaves."
      ],
